    "application": "No safe PRISM-only production fix identified. Keep session-close\u2192ctx.shutdown and separate per-call/cleanup/server-status receipts. Prepare an upstream SDK/server issue from this evidence; none posted. Treat application cleanup receipts independently: callback errors are swallowed by this SDK path, so even a later SDK SUCCESS is insufficient evidence of cleanup success. No production fix is proposed until a supported lifecycle boundary is identified.",
